        "Both output presets3.3V: CFG1=36.5k, CFG2=GND, CFG3=16.2k; SEL=GND. Input current limit unlimited.\nHardware UVLO: ideal thresholds2.09V off /2.30V on. Include comparator offset/reference/hysteresis in bench trip tests.\nUVLO keeps TPS input above its1.8V minimum and suppresses weak-battery restart cycling. Gauge loses power below UVLO.\nC301 counts toward charger filter! 3V3 output may have local bulk; do not add arbitrary VBAT bulk.\nPM pod: budget180mA peak on3V3, switch fully off between samples; schedule separately from radio TX."
