    "notes": [
      [
        18,
        230,
        "REV-A CELL: GWL LTO1865-13 class,1S1P,1.3Ah nominal /0.95Ah guaranteed minimum; keyed fused pigtail.\nGauge VSS/local caps are BAT_NEG, NOT system GND. All charger/load returns must cross R401.\nSRP is cell-negative side; SRN is system-ground side. Kelvin routing; never short BAT_NEG to GND elsewhere.\nREGIN and CE from3V3; REG25 decoupled only. BAT measures raw cell through220R, no high-voltage divider.\nSeparate thermistors J201/J402: do not share biased TS nodes. Select GPCCHEM ChemID/calibrate/learn actual cell.\nNo lithium-ion4.2V substitute. External cell pigtail needs its own fuse near the cell; PCB fuse cannot protect that lead."
      ]
